Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.63,0:01:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.47,0:01:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep lying there, you'll get heatstroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.30,0:01:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You sleep on the roof of the lab all the time anyway, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.51,0:01:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's cloudy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.35,0:02:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.27,0:02:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hashida said he couldn't find her at ComiMa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.10,0:02:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.27,0:02:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I met up with her after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Okabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.82,0:02:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.58,0:02:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.50,0:02:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.42,0:02:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fuck is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you warn me earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.57,0:02:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm soaked down to my underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.15,0:02:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault, Christina, for not listen—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.37,0:03:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.45,0:03:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't exactly trying to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.79,0:03:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault for wearing such thin clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.21,0:03:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot you were such a pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would want to see your featureless figure in the nude?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,One more word, and I'll turn your neocortex into a flower pot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.68,0:03:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of threat is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.85,0:03:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.60,0:03:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I got scratched somewhere while I was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.77,0:03:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Klutz!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.69,0:03:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm what you'd call a "mad scientist."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.40,0:03:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.57,0:03:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.86,0:03:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand that over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.90,0:03:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a sewing kit on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fix it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A sewing kit?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.03,0:03:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I consider myself more family oriented
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,than most people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.79,0:03:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to be clear,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.71,0:03:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,it's dark, so don't expect too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You can look forward to finding out what color thread I used after we leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.09,0:04:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Black, red, pink...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a 33% chance for each one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.22,0:04:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just pray it isn't pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.27,0:04:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.56,0:04:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.48,0:04:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in that stick figure of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.81,0:04:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you... A flower pot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.61,0:04:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could you have gone to rip your clothes like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.74,0:04:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I went to the lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.49,0:04:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,to the laundromat,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.70,0:04:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and on a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I went to your hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.75,0:04:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The hotel? You stopped by?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't answer my messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.84,0:04:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't picking up your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.47,0:04:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you worried about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.47,0:04:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,As head of the lab, it's my job to keep track of my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.43,0:04:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.44,0:04:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.15,0:04:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.02,0:04:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.07,0:04:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just put it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.36,0:04:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in the stick figure of a nude mad scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.66,0:05:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It was probably around here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.80,0:05:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The place I was stabbed...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.89,0:05:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The pain and despair were too real for a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.39,0:05:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.23,0:05:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.73,0:05:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I have some hazy memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.78,0:05:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're weak, almost nonexistent memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and not just of being stabbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.20,0:05:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I also remember you a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.37,0:05:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How desperate you were to save Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.88,0:05:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How you kept pressing forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.17,0:06:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,in pain and all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.09,0:06:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't made it back to your original world,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,yet you kept going,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.31,0:06:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,kept calling her name,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,kept crying...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and kept trying to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.06,0:06:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I see that face,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.40,0:06:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I think about how important she is to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.36,0:06:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and whether it's possible for someone
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.45,0:06:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,to truly care for another person that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.21,0:06:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I wanted to work with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I wanted to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.05,0:06:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.80,0:06:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,save Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You must save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.40,0:07:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If we go to the Beta worldline,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that better than anyone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.08,0:07:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one option.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.37,0:07:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.54,0:07:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me to abandon you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.21,0:07:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there any other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.38,0:07:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about it since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.13,0:07:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,"Isn't there some other way?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.51,0:07:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,"Isn't there something else we can do?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.31,0:07:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But this time, I can't come up with anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,except going to the Beta worldline.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.86,0:07:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.20,0:07:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to accept this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.45,0:07:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.00,0:07:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:07:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't abandon Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.29,0:08:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't let her die while I keep on living.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.17,0:08:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What would be the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.93,0:08:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.73,0:08:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You can run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.99,0:08:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You can run away,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.53,0:08:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but that'll just make it worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.74,0:08:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times you time leap,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.87,0:08:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't get past the 1% barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't know until we try!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll just see Mayuri die...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.50,0:08:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.63,0:08:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.84,0:08:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.09,0:08:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times do you think I've watched her die?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.52,0:08:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen it over...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and over and over and over
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.56,0:09:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't destroy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.23,0:09:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how many times I see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.45,0:09:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri's going to suffer and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you say it doesn't matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If that doesn't affect you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.84,0:09:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,then your heart's already broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.47,0:09:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.09,0:09:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,or you'll really break.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.72,0:09:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.77,0:09:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.69,0:09:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times Mayuri died, I stopped being surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.07,0:09:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I became desensitized without even knowing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.65,0:09:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, I even waited before time leaping, just to see when she'd die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.12,0:09:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,At some point,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.49,0:10:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,it just stopped affecting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Somewhere inside, I was calmly telling myself that I could do it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Save Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.14,0:10:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll truly destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you let her die,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.31,0:10:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll regret it for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I have come this far with our only wish being to save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.61,0:10:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stop, we'll only regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we save her,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.03,0:10:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just go back
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.33,0:10:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to the first worldline, before the D-Mail was sent!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what's best for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's what's best for you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How many times have we fought over these past 20 days?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.05,0:11:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We made fun of each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We talked about our problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.73,0:11:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When my back was against the wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I turned to Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.65,0:11:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kurisu was the one who listened to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}who believed in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At 18, she was already a genius with a published academic paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.49,0:11:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Always calm, always strong-willed,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.03,0:11:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}always so proud and nosy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.75,0:11:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but also always so kind and honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.50,0:11:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her theories continually amazed me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.13,0:11:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and I remembered everything she said
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and watched everything she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.14,0:11:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She wasn't just another lab mem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.51,0:11:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To me, Makise Kurisu was...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.27,0:11:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.95,0:11:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.04,0:12:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.91,0:12:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,for going through so much for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.75,0:12:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.59,0:12:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.09,0:12:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,what does it mean to change worldlines?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.01,0:12:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the second you go to the Beta worldline,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.23,0:12:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll just disappear from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.65,0:12:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe you trade places with another Okabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.23,0:12:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.15,0:12:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.99,0:12:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.91,0:12:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I'm dead in the Beta worldline,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no guarantee that I'm going to die here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.25,0:12:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There could be another me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,amidst all the other infinite worldlines,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and our minds are connected and comprise "me."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.55,0:13:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that'd be wonderful?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be everywhere in every timeline, all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,A great love for someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.23,0:13:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,a great belief in something,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,a great desire to pass on something...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.11,0:13:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If all those things surpass time itself and create "you,"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.99,0:13:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't that be wonderful?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.87,0:13:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't think of it as abandoning me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.25,0:13:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the worldline changes,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.29,0:13:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as you don't forget me, I'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.17,0:13:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.21,0:13:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forget the person I care for most.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.89,0:13:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.85,0:13:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,H-How?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.73,0:13:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.40,0:13:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.53,0:14:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.70,0:14:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to hear your response.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.37,0:14:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you feel about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.25,0:14:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.54,0:14:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.21,0:14:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.88,0:14:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.54,0:14:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.91,0:14:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I didn't want to do that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But experiences such as your first kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.75,0:14:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,are stored in the hippocampus with your strong memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.13,0:15:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,which are harder to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.59,0:15:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.38,0:15:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.51,0:15:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't my first kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.76,0:15:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You insolent virgin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.35,0:15:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.18,0:15:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My first kiss wasn't at all romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.40,0:15:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.02,0:15:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,that last one only left a weak impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.23,0:15:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How about one more?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.03,0:15:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to forget, not ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.15,0:15:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'll take extra care.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.36,0:15:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.70,0:15:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a kiss, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.29,0:15:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Time is passing so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.42,0:15:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.92,0:15:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I feel like complaining to Einstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.43,0:15:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You know, Okabe,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.01,0:15:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}whether time passes slowly or quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.55,0:15:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}depends on your perception.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.89,0:15:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The theory of relativity is so romantic...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.61,0:16:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.16,0:16:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.49,0:16:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about not saying it to Mayuri and Daru?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.62,0:16:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone seeing me off would just make it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.83,0:16:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's only you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.29,0:16:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can leave Japan without any hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.29,0:16:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.51,0:16:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I upgraded it to version 2.67.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.06,0:16:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.27,0:16:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll take it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.69,0:16:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.19,0:16:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.78,0:16:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.66,0:16:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.71,0:17:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were you aiming?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.75,0:17:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.21,0:17:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Comment: 0,0:17:10.76,0:17:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.07,0:17:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.07,0:17:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure that whatever happens, you're going to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.16,0:17:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Only you will remember me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}in a world where no one else does.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.25,0:17:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}More than anyone else, you care for your friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.79,0:17:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so it'll be painful for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.72,0:17:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.34,0:17:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But somehow, I'm glad you'll carry that pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.51,0:17:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For those times when you're sitting around the lab...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.89,0:18:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When you drink a can of juice...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.98,0:18:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When you walk around town...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.90,0:18:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And someday, when you kiss someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.82,0:18:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It doesn't have to be every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.57,0:18:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It can be one time out of a hundred,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.78,0:18:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I'd like you to remember me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.49,0:18:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}because I'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll be there,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}beyond the 1% barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.00,0:18:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.21,0:18:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.26,0:18:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.89,0:18:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.06,0:18:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.40,0:18:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is totally it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.19,0:18:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If we delete this...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.65,0:18:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mission complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.82,0:18:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.90,0:18:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.74,0:19:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We now begin the final phase of Operation Verthandi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.95,0:19:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Our victory is nigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.04,0:19:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We've overcome all conspiracies,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.75,0:19:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,upholding our ideals to the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.96,0:19:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.84,0:19:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,we've fought through the battle of Ragnarok!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.72,0:19:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank those who've worked so hard for me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,to ensure this victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.97,0:19:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I am grateful to all those I've had to sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.73,0:19:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What comes now is the world I wished for!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.86,0:19:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all the choice of Steins Gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.57,0:19:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This world...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.66,0:19:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,will be rewritten!{;_;}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.04,0:19:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kurisu...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.33,0:19:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.39,0:19:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.76,0:20:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm also...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.89,0:20:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.10,0:20:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I also love...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.95,0:20:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.78,0:20:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,who is Lab Mem 004?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.87,0:20:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,004?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.29,0:20:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't a 004.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.01,0:20:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.55,0:20:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle of Ragnarok is undone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.43,0:20:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I, the mad scientist, Hououin Kyouma, have conquered time itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.47,0:20:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,foiling the Organization and SERN's schemes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.81,0:20:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and brought about complete victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.69,0:20:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The world's power structure has been reset,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.36,0:20:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and a future of chaos awaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:21:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the choice of Steins Gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.53,0:21:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.33,0:21:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.37,0:21:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.41,0:21:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I just issued a declaration of victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.71,0:21:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to talk like that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii is okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.63,0:21:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,so you can cry for yourself, Okarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.18,0:21:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We no longer need the PhoneWave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.97,0:21:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I met Kurisu because of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.48,0:21:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.27,0:21:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it also hurt so many others.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.57,0:21:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just as Hououin Kyouma has died,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.32,0:21:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the PhoneWave should die as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Living should mean no do-overs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.75,0:21:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.09,0:21:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\fad(0,500)}Right, Kurisu?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.65,0:23:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.15,0:23:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.95,0:23:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.20,0:23:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,"Dad"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.58,0:23:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.74,0:23:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.16,0:23:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, there's a strange girl who wants to talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.75,0:23:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.54,0:23:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come to the roof of Radio Kaikan immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.21,0:23:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.21,0:23:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come from the year 2036.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.96,0:23:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Hashida Itaru's daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.67,0:23:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Amane Suzuha!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.72,0:23:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzuha?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.72,0:23:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.18,0:23:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.97,0:23:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please believe what I'm about to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.48,0:23:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You must stop World War III.
